{"candidateAnswer":"Through creative collaborations, branded merchandise, online promotions, and engaging content","evidence":"[D5:5 | 9:32 am on 8 February, 2023] Gina: That's awesome! I'm sure you feel great knowing your students are doing so well with dance. It's amazing what it can do for people! Oh, and btw - I've been working hard on my online store and just teamed up with a local artist for some cool designs. Check 'em out!\n[D16:3 | 2:15 pm on 21 June, 2023] Gina: Thanks! This hoodie isn't for sale, it's from my own collection. I made a limited edition line last week to show off my style and creativity - it was tough but worth it!\n[D8:4 | 1:26 pm on 3 April, 2023] Gina: Oof, that's tough, Jon. I got some new offers and promotions going on my online store to try and bring in new customers. It's been a wild ride starting my business, but I'm not giving up!\n[D13:4 | 8:29 pm on 13 June, 2023] Gina: Proud of you for starting your own business! It takes strength to stay hopeful. What are you doing to prep for your dance studio? I have developed a video presentation to teach how to style my fashion pieces, btw. ","itemId":"urn:uuid:64723a3f-c849-5961-83a6-7d2fa882191f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:83470ef0124d15bb68bd7620045404d23c54505b1df02c64d4283898a6755c0c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How did Gina promote her clothes store?","referenceAnswer":"worked with an artist to make unique fashion pieces, made limited-edition sweatshirts, got some new offers and promotions for online store, developed a video presentation showing how to style her pieces","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"83470ef0124d15bb68bd7620045404d23c54505b1df02c64d4283898a6755c0c"}}]}